# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository. Git checks them out with the
# platform's native endings, so this is invisible on Windows while keeping the
# stored history free of the CRLF/LF churn that otherwise shows a whole-file
# rewrite whenever a file is touched from a different OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
